+   Last six: `I'm getting tired of saying it.`
+   Listening notes: Clean. Lira owns the ford reading and calls; Brom's rope comments remain distinct. The read stays shut, so deployment does not move.
+2. First six: `The bar of Thornwater's eastern gate`
