+   Listening notes: Clean. Three surviving hounds enter the sink, making eight accounted for. Cael gives Vastin the release only after `Eight. I counted.` Vastin/Brom/Lira's post-fight exchange is clear; Cael receives no fragment, and the chapter ends before treatment.
